WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:03,215
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,265 --> 00:00:05,150
This is Episode 50.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,432
Maya has a lemonade stand.

4
00:00:07,482 --> 00:00:09,784
Behind it, a tiny crack.

5
00:00:09,834 --> 00:00:11,441
She cannot see it.

6
00:00:11,491 --> 00:00:13,356
But a muddy blob can.

7
00:00:13,406 --> 00:00:14,547
Oh no!

8
00:00:14,597 --> 00:00:16,611
Here comes the crack glass.

9
00:00:16,661 --> 00:00:18,367
It hops on the roof.

10
00:00:18,417 --> 00:00:19,528
Looks.

11
00:00:19,578 --> 00:00:20,699
Nothing.

12
00:00:20,749 --> 00:00:21,939
The front.

13
00:00:21,989 --> 00:00:23,110
Nothing.

14
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,529
The back wall.

15
00:00:24,579 --> 00:00:25,899
It stops.

16
00:00:25,949 --> 00:00:26,941
Ding!

17
00:00:26,991 --> 00:00:28,200
A crack.

18
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:29,888
Maya runs over.

19
00:00:29,938 --> 00:00:31,823
She looks through the glass.

20
00:00:31,873 --> 00:00:33,202
There it is.

21
00:00:33,252 --> 00:00:34,740
Big and clear.

22
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:36,358
Tap tap tap.

23
00:00:36,408 --> 00:00:37,915
A wooden patch.

24
00:00:37,965 --> 00:00:39,086
Fixed.

25
00:00:39,136 --> 00:00:40,853
The blob rolls up.

26
00:00:40,903 --> 00:00:42,480
Looks for the crack.

27
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:43,562
Bonk.

28
00:00:43,612 --> 00:00:44,633
Gone.

29
00:00:44,683 --> 00:00:46,519
The glass keeps looking.

30
00:00:46,569 --> 00:00:47,819
Every day.

31
00:00:47,869 --> 00:00:50,418
Find the crack before the blob does.

32
00:00:50,468 --> 00:00:52,383
That is the crack glass.

33
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:54,447
Now you know Inspector!

34
00:00:54,497 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
